@startuml check_attendance_sequence
title Detailed Sequence Diagram — Check Attendance

actor "HR Administrator" as HR
participant "Attendance Dashboard\n(React)" as UI
participant "PointageController" as Controller
participant "PointageService" as Service
participant "PointageRepository" as Repo
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

HR -> UI : Open HR attendance page
UI -> Controller : GET /api/pointages/summary?date=today
Controller -> Service : getSummary(date)
Service -> Repo : getByDate / aggregate stats
Repo -> DB : SELECT pointages WITH utilisateur
DB --> Repo : attendance records
Repo --> Service : summary data
Service --> Controller : summary
Controller --> UI : JSON response

UI -> Controller : GET /api/pointages/anomalies?days=30
Controller -> Service : getAnomalies(endDate, days)
Service -> Repo : query late/absence patterns
Repo -> DB : SELECT anomalies
DB --> Repo : anomaly list
Repo --> Service : anomalies
Service --> Controller : anomalies
Controller --> UI : JSON response

UI --> HR : Display attendance history,\nsummary KPIs, and anomalies

alt Anomaly detected
  HR -> UI : Review anomaly details
  UI --> HR : Highlight late check-ins\nor missing presence
  HR -> UI : Take corrective action\n(justify absence, contact employee)
else No anomaly
  HR -> UI : Confirm normal attendance
end

@enduml
